<item><title>Mohamud accuses UAE of seeking to divide Somalia and Sudan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/mohamud-accuses-uae-of-seeking-to-divide-somalia-and-sudan-3c0ed4/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/mohamud-accuses-uae-of-seeking-to-divide-somalia-and-sudan-3c0ed4/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>The Somali president said the Emirates had returned from Libya and Yemen divided, as Somalia faces disputes over elections and regional authority.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:04:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Somaliland detains five Americans over alleged national security threat</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somaliland-detains-five-americans-over-alleged-national-453750/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somaliland-detains-five-americans-over-alleged-national-453750/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>The intelligence agency said it monitored the US nationals after their arrival; a person familiar with the matter said they left on Monday.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:07:05 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
